# AI-Powered Student Meeting Planner (Overlap Engine Redesign)

Redesign and upgrade the Overlap Engine from legacy manual section/file uploads into a fully automatic AI-powered **Student Meeting Planner** integrated directly with synchronized E-Zone academic schedules.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Legacy Upload Removal**: Manual timetable upload modals, section selectors, drag-and-drop file parsers, and PDF/Excel handling in the Overlap Engine will be completely removed.
> - **Direct Database Integration**: All student schedules will be automatically queried from the synchronized `EzoneAcademicProfile` database (E-Zone Sync) and `AcademicSchedule` collections.
> - **Multi-Tenant Security**: Student searches and schedule calculations are strictly isolated by `organizationId`. Users can only search and calculate overlaps with students in their own organization.

---

## Proposed Changes

### Backend Components

#### 1. Data Models & Interface Extensions
- Utilize existing `EzoneAcademicProfile`, `User`, `AcademicSchedule`, and `Person` models.
- Build helper routines to map raw schedule items into standard 5-day time slots (e.g. 09:00 - 16:40 or standard period slots).

#### 2. Overlap Service & Scoring Engine (`backend/src/services/overlapService.ts`)
- **Student Search**:
  - Implement `searchStudents(query: string, organizationId: string, currentUserId: string)`:
    - Queries `EzoneAcademicProfile` joined with `User` or `Person` matching `studentName` or `systemId` via regex/case-insensitive search.
    - Enforces `organizationId` matching, `isActive: true`, and `_id != currentUserId`.
    - Returns student search cards payload: `{ id, userId, studentName, systemId, department, semester, school, program, isSynced, avatarUrl }`.
- **Automatic Timetable Fetching & Intersection**:
  - Implement `calculateStudentOverlap(studentIds: string[], currentUserId: string, organizationId: string)`:
    - Fetches `EzoneAcademicProfile` timetables for the logged-in student AND up to 5 selected target students.
    - Converts weekly timetable slots into continuous free time intervals across Monday – Friday (and Saturday if present).
    - Computes N-way interval intersection across all participant schedules.
- **Smart Ranking & Scoring Model (0–100)**:
  - Evaluates each common free time slot against ranking criteria:
    1. **Duration Bonus**: Longer uninterrupted windows score higher.
    2. **Lunch Alignment**: Slots overlapping 12:00–14:00 get a lunch sync bonus.
    3. **Afternoon Preference**: 13:00–16:00 slots prioritized for group study.
    4. **Continuous Class Gap**: Slots with clean pre/post gaps receive higher scores.
    5. **Participant Count**: Full availability vs partial availability (if subset options allowed).
  - Emits `Best Recommendation` with star rating (★★★★★) and explanation reason, plus sorted `Other Available Slots`.

#### 3. Overlap Controllers & API Routes
- Update `backend/src/controllers/overlapController.ts`:
  - `searchStudents`: Handler for `GET /api/overlap-engine/search-students?q=...&organizationId=...`
  - `calculateStudentOverlap`: Handler for `POST /api/overlap-engine/find` receiving `{ studentIds: string[], organizationId: string }`.
- Update `backend/src/routes/overlapRoutes.ts`:
  - `GET /search-students` $\rightarrow$ `searchStudents`
  - `POST /find` $\rightarrow$ `calculateStudentOverlap`
  - Maintain backward compatibility for `/sections` if referenced elsewhere, while upgrading the primary engine endpoints.

