#### 4. API Client (`utils/api/overlapAPI.ts`)
- Add `searchStudents(query: string, organizationId: string)` endpoint caller.
- Add `findStudentOverlap(studentIds: string[], organizationId: string)` endpoint caller.

#### 5. Overlap Engine Page UI (`app/dashboard/student/overlap/page.tsx`)
- **Header**: Refine title to *"Find Common Free Time"* / *"AI Student Meeting Planner"*.
- **Left Panel ("Find Student")**:
  - Search bar with 300ms debouncing (`useDebounce`).
  - Search results list showing student avatar, name, system ID, department, semester/year, and E-Zone sync verification badge.
  - "Selected Students" panel displaying chips (max 5) with easy removal `x` buttons.
  - Gradient **"Find Common Free Time"** button (enabled when $\ge 1$ student selected).
- **Right Panel ("Meeting Recommendations")**:
  - **Best Recommendation Hero Card**:
    - Star Rating (★★★★★)
    - Day, Start Time, End Time, Duration
    - Score badge (e.g. `Score 98`)
    - AI Explanation Reason (e.g., *"Longest uninterrupted common slot in the afternoon"*).
  - **Other Available Slots**:
    - List of secondary free slots sorted by Meeting Score.
    - Copy meeting details button.
  - **Empty & Error States**:
    - Initial state: *"Search and select students to discover shared free time."*
    - Zero overlap state: *"No common free slot exists between selected students."* with a *"Suggest Alternative Day"* action.

