## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to verify frontend compilation.
- Run `npm run lint` / `npx tsc --noEmit` to verify type safety and zero ESLint errors.
- Run unit/integration tests for backend overlap calculation.

### Manual Verification
- Log in as a student in the browser.
- Open `/dashboard/student/overlap`.
- Type a student name or system ID in the search bar.
- Select 1 to 5 students and verify chips in "Selected Students".
- Click "Find Common Free Time" and verify AI-ranked meeting recommendations and score calculations.
- Confirm organization isolation (cannot find or view students outside the user's organization).
